
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sign In</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0-beta3/css/all.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" />
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

        :root {
            --bg-light-gray: #f2f5fa;
            --main-blue: #2172D8;
            --dark-blue-gradient-start: #2172D8;
            --dark-blue-gradient-end: #2D80EB;
            --light-blue-text: #d8effd;
            --white-text: #ffffff;
            --dark-grey-text: #333333;
            --medium-grey-text: #777777;
            --light-grey-border: #cccccc;
            --box-shadow-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            --border-radius-lg: 20px;
            --border-radius-md: 10px;
            --border-radius-sm: 5px;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-light-gray);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: var(--dark-grey-text);
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .login-container {
            display: flex;
            background-color: var(--white-text);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-lg);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px var(--box-shadow-color);
            overflow: hidden;
            width: 900px;
            max-width: 90%;
            min-height: 500px;
        }

        .left-panel {
            flex: 1.2;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--dark-blue-gradient-start) 0%, var(--dark-blue-gradient-end) 100%);
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px;
            position: relative;
            color: var(--white-text);
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .left-panel::before,
        .left-panel::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0) 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .left-panel::before {
            width: 250px;
            height: 250px;
            top: -50px;
            left: -80px;
            transform: rotate(-30deg);
        }

        .left-panel::after {
            width: 350px;
            height: 350px;
            bottom: -100px;
            right: -120px;
            opacity: 0.7;
            transform: rotate(20deg);
        }

        .welcome-title {
            font-size: 36px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: var(--white-text);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .headline-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            color: var(--light-blue-text);
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .description {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: var(--light-blue-text);
            max-width: 350px;
        }

        .right-panel {
            flex: 1;
            background-color: var(--white-text);
            padding: 40px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .signin-header {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            color: var(--dark-grey-text);
        }

        .signin-subheader {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--medium-grey-text);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .input-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--medium-grey-text);
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            left: 15px;
            pointer-events: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .input-group input {
            width: calc(100% - 30px);
            padding: 15px;
            border: 1px solid var(--light-grey-border);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-sm);
            font-size: 16px;
            outline: none;
            color: var(--dark-grey-text);
            background-color: transparent;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            border-color: var(--main-blue);
        }

        .input-group input:focus + label,
        .input-group input:not(:placeholder-shown) + label {
            top: -10px;
            left: 5px;
            font-size: 12px;
            background-color: var(--white-text);
            padding: 0 5px;
            color: var(--main-blue);
        }

        .password-group {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            position: relative;
        }

        .password-group input {
            flex-grow: 1;
            padding-right: 70px;
        }

        .password-toggle {
            position: absolute;
            right: 15px;
            color: var(--main-blue);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .options-group {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .remember-me {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            color: var(--dark-grey-text);
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .remember-me input[type="checkbox"] {
            display: none;
        }

        .remember-me .checkbox-custom {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            border: 1px solid var(--light-grey-border);
            border-radius: 3px;
            margin-right: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: inline-flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background-color: var(--white-text);
        }

        .remember-me input[type="checkbox"]:checked + .checkbox-custom {
            background-color: var(--main-blue);
            border-color: var(--main-blue);
        }

        .remember-me .checkbox-custom .fa-check {
            color: var(--white-text);
            font-size: 12px;
            display: none;
        }

        .remember-me input[type="checkbox"]:checked + .checkbox-custom .fa-check {
            display: block;
        }

        .forgot-password {
            color: var(--main-blue);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .forgot-password:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .signin-button {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background-color: var(--main-blue);
            color: var(--white-text);
            border: none;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius-sm);
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(33, 114, 216, 0.4);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .signin-button:hover {
            background-color: #1a60bf;
            box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(33, 114, 216, 0.5);
        }

        .signup-text {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--medium-grey-text);
        }

        .signup-text a {
            color: var(--main-blue);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .signup-text a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        ::-webkit-input-placeholder {
            color: transparent;
        }
        ::-moz-placeholder {
            color: transparent;
        }
        :-ms-input-placeholder {
            color: transparent;
        }
        :-moz-placeholder {
            color: transparent;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-container">
        <div class="left-panel">
            <h1 class="welcome-title">WELCOME</h1>
            <h2 class="headline-name">YOUR HEADLINE NAME</h2>
            <p class="description">
                Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit, sed diam nonummy nibh euismod tincidunt ut laoreet dolore magna aliquam erat volutpat. Ut wisi enim ad minim quis nostrud exerci tation.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="right-panel">
            <h2 class="signin-header">Sign in</h2>
            <p class="signin-subheader">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit</p>

            <div class="input-group">
                <input type="text" id="username" placeholder="User name">
                <label for="username">User name</label>
            </div>

            <div class="input-group password-group">
                <input type="password" id="password" placeholder="Password">
                <label for="password">Password</label>
                <span class="password-toggle">SHOW</span>
            </div>

            <div class="options-group">
                <label class="remember-me">
                    <input type="checkbox" checked>
                    <span class="checkbox-custom">
                        <i class="fas fa-check"></i>
                    </span>
                    Remember me
                </label>
                <a href="#" class="forgot-password">Forgot Password?</a>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="signin-button">Sing In</button>

            <p class="signup-text">Don't have an account? <a href="#">Sign up</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
